        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "Vendored UI libraries (Bootstrap 5, jQuery 3.3.1) shipped in the Asp.NetCore.MVC example app's wwwroot static assets. Math.random only generates DOM/component element ids (getUID) and library-internal bookkeeping values (expando namespace, Sizzle counter) — no token, nonce, key or seed derives from it, so no CSPRNG is required and no remediation in this repo is warranted. Vendor-controlled: replaceable only by upgrading the vendored libraries. The same expressions also ship in the minified dist "
