        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "Ed25519 is one of three API-credential types supported for signing Binance REST and WebSocket requests (HMAC-SHA256 default, Ed25519 on .NET 8+, RSA-SHA256). All 7 sites are one logical asset: the Ed25519Credential type (constructors/accessors in BinanceCredentials.cs) and the dispatch SignEd25519(ed25519Cred, data, Base64) in BinanceAuthenticationProvider.Sign. The actual signature is computed by the CryptoExchange.Net AuthenticationProvider wrapper. Replacing Ed25519 with a PQ signature scheme"
